tt-local-generator (0.53.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * fix(create): Create surface goes full-width and hides the Discover detail
    pane. It previously showed a dead "click a card to preview" placeholder
    that the Create surface's possibility tiles never feed (they seed the
    composer) -- a false-promise pane. Discover re-shows the pane (it has
    cards to preview).

